      "side": 1,
      "message": "We talked a little on chat. I went through PD spec and in 2.5.2 Sink Operation I found this: https://screenshot.googleplex.com/6xZiJY9jEGVhjVm\n\nWhat I see in logs with extra prints, when doing `cc snkdts` on DUT EC side we clearly detect disconnection but we do not enable vbus discharging and it was earlier disabled by this explicitly added logic (crrev/c/3044411 - due to vendor specific vendor as i understand all bug/cl history). \n\nSo that change makes us more spec compliant and keeps that historical quirk.. or maybe I\u0027m reading spec too selectively, note that I do not have too much expirience working with that spec.",
